{"code":"cs-CZ","name":"Czech","native":"Čeština","badge":"CZ","tts":"cs-CZ","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"Nerozumím.","say":"NEH-ro-zoo-meem","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"Nevím.","say":"NEH-veem","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"Moment, prosím.","say":"MO-ment, PRO-seem","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"Můžete to zopakovat?","say":"MOO-zheh-teh to ZO-pa-ko-vat","en":"Can you say that again?","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"Pomaleji, prosím.","say":"PO-ma-leh-yi, PRO-seem","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"Jak se řekne „…“ česky?","say":"yak seh RZHEK-neh … CHES-ki","en":"How do you say “…” in Czech?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"Jasně.","say":"YAS-nyeh","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"Přesně.","say":"PRZHES-nyeh","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"Myslím, že jo.","say":"MIS-leem zheh yo","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"Fakt?","say":"fakt","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"V pohodě.","say":"f PO-ho-dyeh","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"Super!","say":"SOO-per","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"Kde je {x}?","say":"gdeh yeh {x}","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"Dal bych si {x:acc}.","say":"dal bikh si {x:acc}","en":"I'd like {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"Máte {x:acc}?","say":"MAA-teh {x:acc}","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x:acc}, prosím.","say":"{x:acc}, PRO-seem","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"Musím {x}.","say":"MOO-seem {x}","en":"I have to {x}.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"leave"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"Můžu {x}?","say":"MOO-zhoo {x}","en":"Can I {x}?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed","frame":true,"takes":"verb","ex":"comein"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"Podívám se na to.","say":"PO-dyee-vaam seh na to","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"Mám poradu.","say":"maam PO-ra-doo","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"Je to pálivé?","say":"yeh to PAA-li-vair","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"Bez cibule, prosím.","say":"bez TSI-boo-leh, PRO-seem","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"Co byste doporučil?","say":"tso BIS-teh DO-po-roo-chil","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"Nejím maso.","say":"NEH-yeem MA-so","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"Kolik to stojí?","say":"KO-lik to STO-yee","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"Jen se dívám.","say":"yen seh DYEE-vaam","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"Vezmu si to.","say":"VEZ-moo si to","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"Můžu platit kartou?","say":"MOO-zhoo PLA-tyit KAR-toh","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"Je to daleko?","say":"yeh to DA-leh-ko","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"Na letiště, prosím.","say":"na LEH-tyish-tyeh, PRO-seem","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"doleva · doprava · rovně","say":"DO-leh-va · DO-pra-va · ROV-nyeh","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"Pomoc!","say":"PO-mots","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"Není toaletní papír.","say":"NEH-nyee TO-a-let-nyee PA-peer","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"Je mi špatně.","say":"yeh mi SHPAT-nyeh","en":"I feel sick.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"Zavolejte sanitku, prosím.","say":"ZA-vo-lay-teh SA-nit-koo, PRO-seem","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"Těší mě.","say":"TYEH-shee mnyeh","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"Odkud jste?","say":"OT-koot yste","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"Co děláte?","say":"tso DYEH-laa-teh","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"Je to výborné!","say":"yeh to VEE-bor-nair","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"Ahoj.","say":"A-hoy","en":"Hi. (casual)","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"Dobré ráno.","say":"DOB-rair RAA-no","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"Jak se máte?","say":"yak seh MAA-teh","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"Ano. · Ne.","say":"A-no · neh","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"Prosím.","say":"PRO-seem","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"Děkuju.","say":"DYEH-koo-yoo","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"Promiňte.","say":"PRO-min-teh","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"Na shledanou.","say":"NA-skhleh-da-noh","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"jedna · dva · tři","say":"YED-na · dva · trzhi","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"čtyři · pět · šest","say":"CHTI-rzhi · pyet · shest","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"sedm · osm · devět","say":"SEH-dum · O-sum · DEH-vyet","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"deset · dvacet · sto","say":"DEH-set · DVA-tset · sto","en":"10 · 20 · 100"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"Jablko je červené.","say":"YAB-ul-ko yeh CHER-veh-nair","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “a / the” · the adjective agrees"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"Jím jablko.","say":"yeem YAB-ul-ko","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"-m = I, so no “já” needed"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"Snědl jsem jablko.","say":"SNYED-ul sem YAB-ul-ko","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past: -l + jsem (a woman says snědla)"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"Chci sníst jablko.","say":"khtsi sneest YAB-ul-ko","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"helper + infinitive"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"Jíš jablka?","say":"yeesh YAB-ul-ka","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"the voice goes up"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"toaleta","say":"TO-a-leh-ta","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"lékárna","say":"LAI-kaar-na","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"nemocnice","say":"NEH-mots-nyi-tseh","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"nádraží","say":"NAA-dra-zhee","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"letiště","say":"LEH-tyish-tyeh","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"hotel","say":"HO-tel","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"voda","say":"VO-da","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink","acc":"vodu","accSay":"VO-doo"},{"id":"coffee","t":"káva","say":"KAA-va","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink","acc":"kávu","accSay":"KAA-voo"},{"id":"bill","t":"účet","say":"OO-chet","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"jídelní lístek","say":"YEE-del-nyee LEES-tek","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"pivo","say":"PI-vo","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"tohle","say":"TO-hleh","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"taška","say":"TASH-ka","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag","acc":"tašku","accSay":"TASH-koo"},{"id":"meeting","t":"porada","say":"PO-ra-da","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"soubor","say":"SOH-bor","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"obrazovka","say":"O-bra-zof-ka","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"zpráva","say":"SPRAA-va","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"zítra","say":"ZEE-tra","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"},{"id":"leave","t":"jít","say":"yeet","en":"go","kind":"verb","tags":"leave go"},{"id":"comein","t":"dál","say":"daal","en":"come in","kind":"verb","tags":"enter"},{"id":"pay","t":"zaplatit","say":"ZA-pla-tyit","en":"pay","kind":"verb","tags":"card cash"}],"diet":{"title":"Alergie · prosím přečtěte si","ask":"Obsahuje toto jídlo některou z těchto surovin?","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"Moc děkuju!","note":"","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"Mám silnou alergii na arašídy. Nesmím jíst arašídy ani arašídový olej.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"Mám silnou alergii na mořské plody (krevety, kraby, mušle).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"Nesmím jíst lepek (pšenice, ječmen, žito).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"Nejím maso, kuře ani ryby.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"Nejím vepřové.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"TOALETY · WC","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"ŽENY · MUŽI","en":"Women · Men"},{"t":"VÝCHOD · VCHOD","en":"Exit · Entrance (one letter apart!)","warn":true},{"t":"TAM · SEM","en":"Push · Pull (on doors)"},{"t":"NOUZOVÝ VÝCHOD","en":"Emergency exit"}]}